{"parse": {"title": "CO-14", "pageid": 100925, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/CO-13\" title=\"CO-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">CO-14</span><a href=\"/wiki/CO-15\" title=\"CO-15\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">CO</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">14</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.BF.BD.E6.98.9F.E6.98.9F.E7.9A.84.E4.BA.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"追星星的人\">追星星的人</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 追星星的人</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">We Who Chase the Stars</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>离<span class=\"color-value\"></span>家<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>故<span class=\"color-value\"></span>事<span class=\"color-value\"></span>中<span class=\"color-value\"></span>漂<span class=\"color-value\"></span>流<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2710114</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_kuangkeng1\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_kuangkeng1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng1.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng1.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng1.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>绝大多数情况下，说服自己比说服他人更困难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>察觉到库珀花环的失落，年轻人还是谨慎地开口了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>关于这个……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我不知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如此直截了当的回答让还在思考措辞的职员险些咬到舌头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我刚听到父母的死讯，就坐上了去拉普拉斯分部的大巴，什么都没来得及想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我以为自己完全接受了事实，对没法改变的事情你能做什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>过了两三个月，我写研究日志的时候不小心摔坏了笔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>不夸张地说，我哭了整整四十个小时。天哪，感谢当时的舍友没把我拖出门锁在外头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>那是他们留给你的……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“冷周六会哭”这件事也让她颇感震惊，但她会及时掐断自己不够礼貌的念头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>拉普拉斯配发的。如果你需要，每个月都能免费换新，没人会管。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>但以前我在家摔坏了什么东西，会被批评不够小心——接着他们再和我一块儿选新的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你根本没法真的说服自己，你只能不去想它，或者找很多理由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>像缠胶带球那样一点点裹起来，当你忙着考虑胶带要怎么卷，其实也就分心了。慢慢地就会看上去好点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我会试试这个方法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小宇航员郑重地点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>这是过来人的经验之谈。小孩子总爱想这个，弄掉了作业本就会觉得人生到此为止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>的确如此。职员把用于缓和气氛的话都咽了回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在出发前他听过类似的问题。他也问过自己类似的问题。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_chucangjian\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_chucangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>你要回家看看吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>不，只是去出任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>维拉说，外边是一个你们都很熟悉的时候。但你们都不打算回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>我知道维拉住到来亚什基之前也有一个家。你来基金会之前肯定也有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>那是什么样的地方？也下雪吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>会下雪。雪把白桦枝干压低，也会把野兔和其他动物的足迹盖住。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>沃尔霍夫河结冰的时候，我和妹妹就砸开冰面钓鱼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>帕索诺从冰上掉下去过，他有好几个星期没来上学。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>确实很危险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>传说里溺水的少女会变成鲁萨尔卡。他向维拉验证过，这只是个传说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大部分故事都是如此。在流传的过程里被过度加工。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>为了和仍在思考的小男孩对话，或者为了控制浮起的回忆，他蹲下身，脑袋差不多和那朵向日葵平齐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-311814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-311814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-311814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>不过它已经不存在了。虽然还能在地图上找到，但那不一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>我知道。就像来亚什基。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>……就像来亚什基。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它也只是被“暴雨”剥离了故事的一小块土地。记得的人寥寥无几。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他试图把话题往回拽，以免对话滑往全然无法应付的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-311801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-311801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-311801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>好好活着，很多事情就会突然在某天得到解决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-627920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-627920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-627920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>列尼亚，活着比什么都重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-627920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-627920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-627920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>穿过雪地往我告诉你的方向走，别回头。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_ruzhishenqing1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_ruzhishenqing1\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_ruzhishenqing1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_7_at_ruzhishenqing1.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_ruzhishenqing1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_7_at_ruzhishenqing1.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_ruzhishenqing1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_7_at_ruzhishenqing1.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_ruzhishenqing1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会登记员：</div><div>能独立出外勤任务，差不多就能正式入职了，恭喜你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会登记员：</div><div>大部分人都会在申请书上填个代称，也有少数人用真名，这个随你喜欢。但要改起来比较麻烦，你得好好想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>好的，谢谢您的提醒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>离开家乡的日期与另一个即将被庆祝的日子很接近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就这个。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_ruzhishenqing2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_ruzhishenqing2_zone\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_ruzhishenqing2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-2_7_at_ruzhishenqing2_zone.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_ruzhishenqing2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"371\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-2_7_at_ruzhishenqing2_zone.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_ruzhishenqing2_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-2_7_at_ruzhishenqing2_zone.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_ruzhishenqing2_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1684\" data-file-height=\"1040\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他递出了填好的申请书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会登记员：</div><div>我看看……好，没问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会登记员：</div><div>“暴雨”可给大伙儿添了不少麻烦……眼下正缺人手，之后得加油干活儿啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会登记员：</div><div>圣洛夫基金会远东分部欢迎您的加入，命名日先生。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>名字意味着存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>地图上找不到的城市，与地图上同名却截然不同的城市，哪种更不可接受？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他尝试过，自己的神秘术并不能对生命体生效，记忆中稍纵即逝的辉光大概只是错觉。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_chucangjian\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_chucangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>你在想什么？你想家了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>没关系。维拉说只要认真上课，学好了知识，在哪里都可以重建我们的家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>只要每位同志都不忘记！当然，我记得很牢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>向日葵歪过脑袋。孩子学着自己看过的那样，拍了拍朋友的肩膀，送出一点鼓励。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>加油，浣熊同志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>非常感谢，阿夫西维同志。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_kuangkeng2\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_kuangkeng2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在基金会职员被思考绊住的时候，极光已经铺满了天幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它遵循既定的规律，恒常且绚烂，不必依靠某个词语而存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自然中并没有围绕人类打造的事物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>把最好的位置让给你，来，阿涅娅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>其实我已经习惯被叫做库珀花环了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她小声咕哝了一句，但还是走到了预留出的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>抓紧机会，这可是难得的极光爆发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>——你的神秘术得依靠里面的高能带电粒子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>原来我们不只是出来散心……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>散心，顺便给你多添一份保障。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_dahezhao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_dahezhao\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_dahezhao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-2_7_at_dahezhao.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_dahezhao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-2_7_at_dahezhao.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_dahezhao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-2_7_at_dahezhao.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_dahezhao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她找了块合适的石头坐下，顺手帮库珀花环和远旅拍了拍旁边石块上的灰尘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>别太紧张了，在宇宙里散步可比走在钢丝上简单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>宇宙中没有绝对的方向之分，下落同时也能是上升。这取决于你使用的参照体系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>简而言之，只要你愿意这么想，往哪走都一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小宇航员认真地点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>明天，后天……后天我就要去亲眼看一看头顶这些星星了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>不知道它们摸上去有没有温度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>出于紧张，又或者是因为夜风太冷，她稍微有些发颤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六伸出手，连带着远旅一块儿揽过来，三个人挤成一团。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>以前天气很冷的时候，我会抱着米莎，就是那只我照料的小熊，跟她一起休息。她身上特别暖和。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>和现在的感觉很像。抱歉，我并不是想说你们像小动物……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>只是这样很安心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>我明白，那些格外难捱的冬天，得靠兄弟姐妹们捉几条附近的流浪狗，挤在一块儿取暖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>我没多少过冬的经验，你们不能直接选择冬眠吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从这支小队凑齐以来，他们第一次这样轻松地聊天，谈论与任务无关的内容，提起遥远的过去和生活至今的经历。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不知不觉，一点儿困倦悄然涌上库珀花环的脑袋。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_kuangkeng2\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_kuangkeng2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她站起身，试图摆脱这阵突然袭来的疲惫。冷周六也跟着她站了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>准备回去吧，别让我们的小宇航员累坏了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>但你还没说过你为什么要坚持到现在呢，别回避话题！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>我一直都很好奇这个问题，你看起来不像会喜欢数星星的那种人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>是吗？好吧，新的刻板印象又多了一种。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员偏了偏头，恰好把打着瞌睡的小蛇托回肩膀上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>为了了解我们自己从何而来，将如何结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>这个理由还不够充分吗？对我而言已经足够。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>或者你想听个更加正式的说法？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>之前我和指针快被手上的活儿逼疯，就会抽空过来散个心，她通常这么说——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她稍稍眯起眼，饶有兴致地观察着那片绵延的光幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>来自太阳的高能带电粒子，在地球磁场的作用下呈现出肉眼可见的炫目色彩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几乎可以听见它们微弱而含混的爆裂声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>有了语言之后，人就能够描绘宇宙何以至此，又何以终结。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>知晓死亡与短暂，人就开始追求存在的永恒，并思考自身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>轻轻晃了晃脑袋后，她重新找回了平时略微散漫的语气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>这可是我学指针说话学得最像的句子——每个见过的同事都这么夸我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天幕上高悬的极光回望着地面的人群。<br />绚丽的光线落下，模糊了雪地与天空的交界，也令每个人的表情都变得朦胧不清。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六的声音像是从远处传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>明天很可能是“暴雨”前的最后一天空闲时间了。对了。你们有没有想过这个问题——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>如果明天是生命中最后一天，该去做点什么？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "CO-14"}}